# 前端构建上下文只允许源文件、锁和Nginx配置；.local/JAR/其他后台代码不进入上下文。
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!web-user/
!web-user/**
!web-admin/
!web-admin/**
!web-shared/
!web-shared/**
!deploy/
!deploy/Dockerfile.web
!deploy/Dockerfile.web.dockerignore
!deploy/web/
!deploy/web/nginx.conf
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.local
**/.git
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
